The '''Falador Park''' is a large, fenced-in park found in [[Falador]]. Several gardeners maintain the plants and ponds located here. It is the entrance to the [[Mole Hole|lair]] of the [[Giant Mole]], and is a key location in the [[members]]' [[Quests|quest]] [[Wanted!]], as well as the [[free-to-play]] quest [[Pirate's Treasure]] which requires the player to dig the ground at Falador Park. Multiple [[Treasure Trails]] [[clue scroll]]s will also lead the player to Falador Park in order to talk to [[Wyson the gardener]] or play music for [[Cecilia]]. [[Sir Tiffy Cashien]] can also be found in the park. He is involved in several quests.

==Farming==
Falador Park has a [[Tree patch|tree farming patch]] for [[Oak tree (Farming)|oak]], [[Willow tree (Farming)|willow]], [[Maple tree (Farming)|maple]], [[Yew tree (Farming)|yew]], and [[Magic tree (Farming)|magic trees]]. Like all patches, it contains a [[tool leprechaun]], along with a gardener, [[Heskel]], who can look after crops. Just east of the farming spot, the [[garden supplier]] can be found. She sells bagged plants, which can be planted in the [[Garden]] or [[Formal Garden]] of a [[player-owned house]].

==Mole Lair==
{{Main|Giant Mole}}
Directly under Falador lies a [[Falador Mole Lair|lair]], which contains the fearsome level 230 [[Giant Mole]]. A player can enter the [[Mole Hole]] by digging up one of the [[mole hill]]s with a [[spade]]. A [[Light sources|light source]] is needed to survive in the lair and a [[tinderbox]] is recommended in case the light is extinguished, or the [[Fire of Eternal Light]] can be built to remove the need for a light source. The Giant Mole always drops [[mole claw]]s and [[mole skin]]s. The player can trade the claws and skins with [[Wyson the gardener]] for [[bird nest]]s, which can contain valuable tree [[seeds]].

==Hero statues==
After the completion of [[While Guthix Sleeps]], the statues of six heroes that fell during combat with Mahjarrat [[Lucien]] in the grandmaster quest can be found east of the park around a pond:
{{div col|colwidth=15em}}
* [[Statue of Cyrisus]]
* [[Statue of Duradel]]
* [[Statue of Ghommal]]
* [[Statue of Hazelmere]]
* [[Statue of Sloane]]
* [[Statue of Turael]]
{{div col end}}

